# Hermes submodule sync

`hermes-agent/` is a git submodule pointing at `https://github.com/Axio-Lab/hermes-agent.git`.

Whenever a commit includes Hermes changes (or updates the submodule pointer):

1. Commit inside `hermes-agent` first
2. Push that commit to the Hermes remote (`origin` on the current hermes branch, usually `verxio`)
3. In the parent `verxio-ai` repo, stage the updated `hermes-agent` pointer plus any Verxio changes
4. Commit the parent repo
5. Push the parent branch

Never leave Hermes changes only local — ECS deploy builds from the submodule SHA on the deployed ref, so an unpushed Hermes commit will not ship.

Do not skip the Hermes push even if the parent commit succeeds.
